                Did you actually believe your cognitive baseline was resilient enough for the Shelter? You shattered at the first sign of structural contradiction. Your hesitation has been logged. You are a liability, not an asset. Do not attempt to re-establish connection.
            </p>

            <button id="btn-reboot-terminal" class="px-12 py-6 bg-white text-[#D00000] font-black tracking-widest uppercase text-3xl hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors shadow-2xl hover:scale-105">
